493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244030/extras/ceda961356e012e5abf38fd781dc93d5.mp4?t=1770925493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange, funny plot with a deep focus on humour and character writing. It gets silly. It gets serious. Really concerningly serious. Uh. Is the guy who made this game okay..?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">BUT FIRST, LOVE YOURSELF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244030/extras/1fdb9c1f779cd4ec0a9b34249dda7683.poster.avif?t=1770925493\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244030/extras/1fdb9c1f779cd4ec0a9b34249dda7683.webm?t=1770925493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244030/extras/1fdb9c1f779cd4ec0a9b34249dda7683.mp4?t=1770925493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save the world, you must save yourself first. Find yourself again.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>RUBATO contains flashing lights which may not be suitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy.</i></p>","developers":["dconn"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244030/f270215803718434ac0b75eead8e503b2d333f80/header.jpg?t=1770925493","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb